# Fleet concurrent

Do not stagger, `sleep` between bot names, or restart the fleet one account at
a time. Pass every name in one `fleet-launchd` / `lite-launchd` command.

Serialize only when hitting a shared **shop inventory** or one GE book. Login,
gateway idle, CPU, and pathfinding are not reasons to stagger.

